WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.044
-[Narrator]: In this instructional video,
you’ll learn all about the ins and outs

00:00:04.044 --> 00:00:07.620
of what’s going to happen in the next
brand-new "Digital Circus."

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:09.546
-[Gangle]: [overly cheerful]
That’s right, team!

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:12.120
We’re working at a fast food place today.

00:00:12.120 --> 00:00:14.586
So, roll up your sleeves
and wash your hands,

00:00:14.586 --> 00:00:16.780
'cause we got burgers to make!

00:00:16.786 --> 00:00:18.977
-[Jax]: Why are you talking like that?
What’s wrong with you?

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:21.924
-[Gangle]: Looks like somebody
doesn’t have their smile on.

00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:24.506
Why don’t you go into the freezer
and get some patties ready?

00:00:24.506 --> 00:00:26.146
[freezer door opens]
-[Previous Narrator]: Oh, thank God.

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.284
-[Pomni]: Yeah,
i-i-it was freezing in there.

00:00:28.280 --> 00:00:30.124
-[Jax]: What were you --
Who is th--

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:31.168
What’s going on???

00:00:31.168 --> 00:00:35.217
-[Gangle]: Find out in the brand new episode
coming atcha soon!!!

00:00:39.102 --> 00:00:43.235
-[Narrator]: And then, nobody was
teleported anywhere ever again,

00:00:43.235 --> 00:00:45.951
and there was everlasting peace.

